# Deploys are prebuilt (ADR-0006): `vercel deploy --prebuilt` uploads
# .vercel/output only, so nothing here is normally consulted.
#
# It exists as the guard for the other path. Should anyone run a plain
# `vercel deploy`, Vercel would upload this directory and build in the cloud —
# and these are the two directories that must never make that trip. Without the
# Corpus the cloud build fails loudly on the missing Identity, which is the
# correct outcome: a deploy that cannot see the Corpus should not produce a site.
content
generated
